  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The mission of Data4Change is to cultivate a data-curious, critical, and confident culture among its partners, African civil society organizations (CSOs), enabling them to leverage citizen-generated data to champion policies that reflect community needs. This grant will strengthen and expand collaborative efforts in East and West Africa to boost local CSOs&#x2019; data, design, and storytelling skills for policy advocacy.</narrative>
  </description>
